      "title": "Student Services Aide (52643)",
      "description": "Student Services Aide (52643) You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Student Services Aide (52643) Apply Overview Salary Range $13.50 Hourly Position Type Part Time - Reg Education Level High School or GED Travel Percentage None Category Student Apply Description Primary Contact: Summer Charley; summercharley@nmhu.edu; 505-566-3552 Job Description: The incumbent in this position will assist with all aspects of the administrative processes of the Farmington Center. Individuals will answer telephone & take messages; accurately & effectively respond to inquiries both in person and on the telephone; provide clerical support to office staff; greet visitors; provide basic information to visitors. Qualifications Minimum Qualifications: - Must be currently enrolled as a student at NMHU with good academic standing. - Must be classified as a sophomore, junior, senior or higher. - Must be enrolled with a minimum of six (6) credit hours. Preferred Qualifications: - Successfully completed one semester at NMHU. - Some administrative/clerical experience. Preferred Skills: - Strong oral and written communication skills. - Strong customer service skills. - Basic computer proficiency. - Ability to work independently and collaboratively in a professional office environment. - Ability to maintain confidentiality and follow university policies and procedures. Share job details to About NEW MEXICO HIGHLANDS UNIVERSITY Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
