    "https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/2881FFE43C19E2921F626A9C2B366153/jobs/229147": {
      "title": "Office Aide (52410)",
      "description": "Office Aide (52410) You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Office Aide (52410) Las Vegas , NM 87701 Apply Overview Salary Range $12.00 Hourly Position Type Part Time - Reg Education Level High School or GED Travel Percentage None Category Student Apply Description The Office Aide provides administrative and customer service support to the department by assisting student, faculty, staff and visitors. Responsibilities include answering phones. greeting guests, filing documents, data entry, scanning and copying materials, assisting with office organizations, distributing nail, and completing other clerical duties as assigned. The Office Aide is expected to maintain confidentiality, demonstrate professionalism, and provide excellent customer service while representing the department. Qualifications Minimum Qualifications: - Must be currently enrolled as a student at New Mexico Highlands University. - Must be eligible for student employment under university guidelines. - Possess basic computer skills, including Microsoft Office applications (Word,Excel,Outlook). - Demonstrate effective verbal and written communication skills. - Ability to work independently and as part of a team. - Reliable, punctual, and dependable. Preferred Qualifications: - Previous customer service or office experience. - Familiarity with office equipment such as copiers, scanners, and multi-line phone systems. - Experience with data entry and maintaining organized records. Preferred Skills: - Strong organizational and time management skills. - Excellent interpersonal and customer service skills. - Attention to detail and accuracy. - Ability to prioritize multiple tasks in a fast-paced office environment. - Problem-solving and critical thinking abilities. - Ability to learn new software and university systems quickly. - Ability to maintain confidentiality while handling sensitive information. Share job details to About NEW MEXICO HIGHLANDS UNIVERSITY Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
