d responsible work habits. Good communication and interpersonal skills. Ability to operate motor vehicles and or equivalent. Problem-solving skills and ability to follow instructions. Commitment to maintaining a clean and safe work environment. Share job details to About NEW MEXICO HIGHLANDS UNIVERSITY Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
