      "title": "Custodian  (50254)",
      "description": "Custodian  (50254) You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Custodian  (50254) Las Vegas , NM 87701 Apply Overview Salary Range $15.00 - $21.75 Hourly Position Type Temporary - Full Time Education Level High School or GED Travel Percentage None Category Staff Apply Description SUMMARY: This position is responsible for maintaining a clean and sterile environment for assigned areas. Duties and Responsibilities: Vacuuming, sweeping, and emptying trash receptacles; Cleans fixtures, blinds, pictures, shelves, drapes and ashtrays; Wash windows, restrooms and kitchenettes, employee lounges, porches, entryways, walls, doors, and windows as needed; Move furniture; Refills toilet supplies in restrooms and hand sanitizer units as needed; Shampoo carpets, strips and waxes floors, as required; Shovels snow in entryways as required; Mop floors on a regular basis; Serves on an on-call list to assist with emergency cleanups; Maintain regular attendance; Perform other related duties as assigned. Qualifications Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities: Ability to understand and carry out verbal and written instruction; Knowledge in properly handling hazardous chemicals and materials; Knowledge in proper cleaning techniques; Ability to use a ladder and operate cleaning equipment (burnishes, buffers, etc.); Knowledge of safety procedures; Ability to read and write effectively. Physical Demands: Lifting 0 to 50 pounds……………………………. Frequently Lifting greater than fifty (50) pounds.… Occasionally Standing……………………………Frequently Walking……………………………. Frequently Bending……………………………. Frequently Squatting….……………….……. Frequently Climbing………………….………. Frequently Kneeling…………….……………. Frequently Working Environment: May be exposed to hazardous chemicals and materials. Work in dirty/dusty conditions………………….……. Frequently Work in noisy conditions….……Occasionally Work around fumes and odors………. Frequently Work in wet and humid environments…………………. Occasionally Work in poorly lit areas……………………………. Occasionally Work on elevated heights……………………………Occasionally Share job details to About NEW MEXICO HIGHLANDS UNIVERSITY Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
