      "description": "Contingent Faculty - Social Work (50275) You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Contingent Faculty - Social Work (50275) Albuquerque, NM 87110; Farmington , NM 87402; Las Vegas , NM 87701; Las Vegas, NM 87701; Rio Rancho, NM 87124 Apply Overview Position Type Part Time - Reg Education Level Masters Degree Category Faculty Apply Description Position Summary Teach undergraduate or graduate per course class(es) in social work. Duties and Responsibilities Teach and facilitate learning of course content. Evaluate students. Manage classroom. Participate in trainings and orientations. Hold regular office hours. Become proficient with Banner and Brightspace as well as use of zoom technology, depending on assigned course. Qualifications Minimum Qualifications MSW, MA, or doctorate degree. Licensure may be required, depending on course taught. Preferred Qualifications Prior teaching experience at college level. Share job details to About NEW MEXICO HIGHLANDS UNIVERSITY Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
