      "description": "Contingent Faculty - Nursing (50287) You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Contingent Faculty - Nursing (50287) Las Vegas, NM 87701; Las Vegas , NM 87701 Apply Overview Position Type Part Time - Reg Education Level Masters Degree Category Faculty Apply Description Salary Range $1,050 per credit hour Position Summary Teaching online courses in the RN to BSN and MSN Programs. Duties and Responsibilities Curriculum development, instruction and management of Nursing courses. Qualifications Minimum Qualifications A master's degree in nursing. Preferred Qualifications Doctorate degree in nursing or related field. Share job details to About NEW MEXICO HIGHLANDS UNIVERSITY Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
