    "https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/2881FFE43C19E2921F626A9C2B366153/jobs/178810": {
      "title": "Contingent Faculty - History & Political Science (50296)",
      "description": "Contingent Faculty - History & Political Science (50296) You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Contingent Faculty - History & Political Science (50296) Las Vegas , NM 87701 Apply Overview Position Type Part Time - Reg Education Level Masters Degree Category Faculty Apply Description Salary Range $1,050 per credit hour Position Summary The Department of History & Political Science offers a B.A. in History. It also has two M.A. graduate programs: Southwest Studies, History & Political Science Concentration; Public Affairs, History Concentration. The Contingent faculty will be responsible for teaching a course in the area of American History (lower & upper division), such as U.S. History I and U.S. History II, Civil War & Reconstruction, Women in the United States, or The American Presidency. Duties and Responsibilities The selected candidate will be responsible for teaching a U.S. History course, course assignments & assessments. Teaching may require the knowledge of different modes of instruction (i.e., Zoom, Asynchronous, In-person, or Blended). Qualifications Minimum Qualifications Master’s or Ph.D. in American History from a Department of History at an accredited university. Experience in teaching History courses. Share job details to About NEW MEXICO HIGHLANDS UNIVERSITY Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
